    {
      "id": "C01",
      "type": "technical",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "轻恢复 · collapse_drain_retry\n\n取出并应用暂存的折叠操作\n此前只识别候选，尚未修改请求\n不额外生成整段历史摘要\n通常更快，信息损失更少",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 1004,
      "width": 534,
      "height": 160,
      "padding": 16,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "minFontSize": 14,
