      "lineHeight": 1.12,
      "align": "left",
      "appearance": "tone-dots"
    },
    {
      "id": "C02",
      "type": "technical",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "重恢复 · reactive_compact_retry\n\n收到 prompt too long 后被动触发\n压缩较早的会话历史\n用摘要与最近消息重建上下文\n成本和延迟更高，可能遗漏细节",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 642,
      "y": 1004,
      "width": 534,
      "height": 160,
      "padding": 16,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "minFontSize": 14,
      "fontWeight": 600,
      "lineHeight": 1.12,
      "align": "left",
      "appearance": "tone-dark"
    },
    {
      "id": "M04",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "为什么按这个顺序？",
